<title>USA: Sega Gameworks names Michael Montgomery pres, COO.</title>
<headline>Sega Gameworks names Michael Montgomery pres, COO.</headline>
<dateline>UNIVERSAL CITY, Calif. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sega GameWorks, a joint venture between Sega Enterprises Ltd, DreamWorks SKG and Seagram Co Ltd's MCA Inc, said it named Michael Montgomery president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He joins Sega GameWorks from DreamWorks, where he led the effort to build the company's studio and raise equity capital.</p>
<p>Sega GameWorks is building a network of entertainment &quot;gathering places&quot; that will incorporate some proprietary interactive games as well as arcade games and simulators, food and merchandise.</p>
</text>
